# AI model usage

- Use OpenRouter only via `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` on the server
- Never expose the key to the browser (`NEXT_PUBLIC_*` is forbidden)
- Never hard-code model IDs; use `src/presentation/ai/model-router.ts`
- Models emit semantic DSL only — never x, y, w, h, fontSize, or other layout fields

```ts
// BAD
const key = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENROUTER_API_KEY;
await fetch("https://api.anthropic.com/...");

// GOOD
const key = process.env.OPENROUTER_API_KEY; // server-only
const model = getModel("strategist");
```
